<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Our Services - Bikesceeme</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('./partials/_navbar') %>

  <section class="services-hero-section">
    <div class="services-hero-content">
      <h1>Explore Our Premium Services</h1>
      <p>From expert bike repairs to custom builds, Bikesceeme offers everything to keep you riding at your best.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-list section-padding">
    <h2 class="section-title">What We Offer</h2>
    <div class="services-container">

      <div class="service-card">
        <img src="/images/red-motor-biking-road.jpg" alt="Bike Repairs" />
        <h3>Bike Repairs & Maintenance</h3>
        <p>Professional repair services for all types of bikes to ensure a smooth and safe ride every time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <img src="/images/harley-davidson-zGzXsJUBQfs-unsplash.jpg" alt="Custom Bike Builds" />
        <h3>Custom Bike Builds</h3>
        <p>Get a personalized bike tailored to your exact riding style, frame size, and aesthetic preferences.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <img src="/images/harley-davidson-QD6GvrDFPAA-unsplash.jpg" alt="Bike Fitting" />
        <h3>Professional Bike Fitting</h3>
        <p>Maximize comfort and performance with our expert bike fitting services, perfect for racers and casual riders alike.</p>
      </div>



   

   

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-cta-section section-padding text-center">
    <h2>Need Help Choosing the Right Service?</h2>
    <p>Our team is here to assist you. Reach out and let’s find the perfect solution for your cycling needs.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-cta">Contact Us</a>
  </section>

  <%- include('./partials/_footer') %>
</body>
</html>
